  "The blade caught the first light. The six friends crossed the gate in time.": "刀片抓住了第一道光。 六个朋友及时穿过大门。",
  "The feather floated against the wind. There was a gaping hole in the sky curtain.": "羽毛随风飘起。 天窗上有一个大洞。",
  "The first drop of water caused the dry, stiff gears under the tower to spin again.": "第一滴水使塔下干燥、僵硬的齿轮再次旋转。",
  "The last part in the box fits the door winch.": "盒子的最后一部分适合门绞车。",
  "Golden petals sprang under the archers' feet. Raise the firing line beyond the wall.": "金色的花瓣在弓箭手的脚下跳了起来。 将火线抬高到墙外。",
  "A stone platform led the team up to a balcony where the stairs were broken.": "一个石头平台将团队带到了一个阳台，楼梯被打破。",
  "The angle of the mirror bends the light beam back into the seal that emitted it.": "镜子的角度将光束弯曲回发射它的密封件。",
  "Repeated letters on the wall reveal which line is the command to close the door.": "墙上重复的字母显示了关闭门的命令。",
  "When the machine stepped onto the frozen ground The joint stopped.": "当机器踏上冻结的地面时，关节停止了。",
  "The hunter's eyes caught the moment the armor plate was revealed. before releasing the arrow": "装甲板被露出的那一刻，猎人的眼睛捕捉到了。 在释放箭头之前",
  "Sparks traced the blade's grooves. Go to extinguish the character at the other end.": "火花追踪了刀片的凹槽。 去消灭另一端的角色。",
  "The tassel on the amulet shakes, warning the wind on the bridge will reverse direction.": "护身符上的流苏摇晃，警告桥上的风会反向。",
  "Arrow at the top of the tower The flames pointed out the target for those who followed.": "塔顶上的箭头 火焰指向了追随者的目标。",
  "Baron Bunny dances in the middle of the courtyard. As everyone passed by the wall": "Baron Bunny在庭院中间跳舞。 当每个人都经过墙壁时",
  "Sharp scales inserted into joints. The seal circle did not rotate completely.": "尖锐的鳞片插入关节中。 密封圈没有完全旋转。",
  "Ushi stomped his feet in front of the checkpoint. The entire line of guards turned towards him.": "乌斯在检查站前跺了跺脚。 整个守卫线转向他。",
  "The baton lifts up the entire beam blocking the way.": "接力棒将整个横梁抬起，挡住了路。",
  "The sickle's scythe caught the light string overhead and tore it apart.": "镰刀的镰刀在头顶抓住了灯串并将其撕裂。",
  "Intelligence from the House of the Hearth reveals a secret route beyond Celestia’s sight.": "来自炉膛之家的情报揭示了一条超出塞莱斯蒂亚视线的秘密路线。",
  "The fang marks on the vine's bark indicate that the tree still has antivenom sap.": "藤蔓树皮上的尖牙标记表明这棵树仍然有抗蛇毒血清汁液。",
  "The smell of herbs helps the forward unit continue walking through the fog.": "草药的气味有助于前方单位继续穿过雾气。",
  "The water revolves around the flag bearer. Receive flak from all sides": "水围绕着旗手。 接收来自四面八方的抨击",
  "The same singing line brings lost people back together.": "同样的歌唱线让迷失的人重新聚在一起。",
  "A single slash cuts through the waves crashing across the bow of the ship.": "一个斜线穿过船头撞击的海浪。",
  "The flag on the mast told the last ship that it was their turn to break through the blockade.": "桅杆上的旗帜告诉最后一艘船，轮到他们突破封锁了。",
  "The circle of lights on the ground became a gathering point as the entire courtyard went dark.": "随着整个庭院的黑暗，地面上的光圈变成了聚集点。",
  "Cloth wrapped around palm This allows the person to continue pulling the rope until the last person comes up.": "布裹在手掌上的布可以让人继续拉绳子，直到最后一个人上来。",
  "The face of the shield is tilted to receive the beam of light. Deflect it from the shelter door.": "防护罩的表面倾斜以接收光束。 将其从避难所门中偏转。",
  "One pitcher of water is shared until the last guard turns before the gates open.": "一罐水被共享，直到最后一个守卫在大门打开之前转动。",
  "Pictures from the front line reveal that the top of the tower darkened before every shot.": "前线的照片显示，塔顶在每次拍摄前都变暗了。",
  "The shutter caught the bright, fleeting symbol.": "快门捕捉到了明亮的、转瞬即逝的符号。",
  "The bullet swerved to follow the target hiding behind the stone pillar.": "子弹转向了躲在石柱后面的目标。",
  "Chasca rides her flying gun beneath the beams, then climbs before the passage closes.": "查斯卡在横梁下骑着她的飞行枪，然后在通道关闭之前爬上去。",
  "The sound of a single gunshot followed by the sound of a door latch falling to the floor.": "一声枪响的声音，接着是门闩落到地上的声音。",
  "Two short whistles ordering the front line to retreat. Open the way for the rear.": "两口短哨命令前线撤退。 为后方开辟道路。",
  "Tamoto holds the curtain between the teams through the illusion screen.": "Tamoto 通过幻觉屏幕为团队之间的窗帘拉开帷幕。",
  "One sword connected to the seal line. The other side is cut at the seam.": "一把剑连接到海豹线。 另一侧在接缝处被切割。",
  "The talisman shakes on the alcove where the shadow resides. The team was able to avoid it in time.": "护身符在阴影所在的壁龛上摇晃。 团队能够及时避免它。",
  "Cold steam freezes the door while closing.": "关闭时，冷蒸汽会冻结门。",
  "Itzpapa floats along as a late-night friend. Alerts you when the seal moves.": "Itzpapa 以深夜的朋友的身份漂浮着。 当密封件移动时提醒您。",
  "Three points of starlight joined together to form a line back to camp.": "三点星光汇聚在一起，形成一条线回营地。",
